WEBVTT

00:02:28.978 --> 00:02:32.690
And too often,
students are totally deflated,

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:37.653
because the teacher is spending more time
on classroom management

00:02:37.695 --> 00:02:39.197
than engaging them.

00:02:40.656 --> 00:02:44.035
So these students
and the generations behind them ...

00:02:45.411 --> 00:02:47.538
they are our talent pool

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:50.333
for everything from community organizing

00:02:50.333 --> 00:02:52.960
to running business,
to running government,

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.795
and everything in between.

00:02:56.005 --> 00:03:00.134
And as it stands,
our public education system